        (= 0.0 in this schema), making the DHW action a no-op. Now uses dhw_storage.capacity.
        Disable with STEMSEnvironment(patch_dhw=False).
==========================================================================
==========================================================================
[STEMS] PATCHED CityLearn defect 't0_thermal_double_count' on 8/8 buildings.
        reset() books the ideal thermal load at t=0, then the first step
        limits devices to nominal power minus that same load (asserts on
        heating, silently clips storage charging). Cleared before step 1.
        Disable with STEMSEnvironment(patch_t0_double_count=False).
==========================================================================
==========================================================================
[STEMS] PATCHED CityLearn defect 'endogenous_obs_from_simulated_hour'.
        The indoor temperature observation reads the uncontrolled dataset
        value, never the simulated one. State observations now come from
        the simulator's series for the hour the action was applied to.
        Disable with STEMSEnvironment(patch_endogenous_obs=False).
==========================================================================
